1113 #uuid "57d1b803-d96d-5b07-af56-e1bfc1202d52" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285854 1145 "First, let's make $t$ the subject of the parametric equations. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}t & =\\frac{x}{4},\\,{t}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSquaring both sides of the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{2} & =\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now eliminate the parameter $t$ by substituting the above into the equation ${t}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}y$ and rearranging to find the Cartesian equation of the parabola, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16} & =\\frac{1}{2}y \\\\ {x}^{2} & =8y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Cartesian equation of the parabola is ${x}^{2}=8y.$" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186285856 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186285857 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186285858 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186285859 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1000 #edb/ref 17592186285860 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1041 "selection" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1104 #edb/ref 17592186285857 13194139534391 true] [17592186285855 1110 #uuid "45b2437f-2ef6-5752-9517-36c471f988fb" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285856 1034 "{x}^{2}=\\frac{1}{8}y" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285856 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534391 true] [17592186285856 1111 #uuid "09323e57-5397-5ea7-9a92-7f28c9ccf23e" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285857 1034 "{x}^{2}=8y" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285857 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534391 true] [17592186285857 1111 #uuid "60302662-bc03-5cd2-b6ac-0c01c93e13e1" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285858 1034 "{x}^{2}=2y" 13194139534391 true] [17592186285858 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534391 true] [17592186285858 1111 #uuid "b7f90974-6eee-5409-af59-f522677f0c24" 13194139534391 true] [1759218